and so in making this latest in a horror film&nbsp;
all shot in one take it was well can we can we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:19.440
just shoot the whole thing can we make a horror&nbsp;
film in one take and can we also have animals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:25.120
